1
00:00:00,023 --> 00:00:02,253
Yang sakit, yang sakit

2
00:00:02,273 --> 00:00:03,303
nak jalan jauh tu,

3
00:00:03,323 --> 00:00:05,833
kaki ke hati?

4
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:08,870
Yang apa nama, yang kalau kita

5
00:00:08,890 --> 00:00:12,500
kena ubat, yang kena rawat ni,

6
00:00:12,540 --> 00:00:13,550
mana?

7
00:00:14,090 --> 00:00:16,770
Kaki kah yang nak kena ubat ni ke,

8
00:00:16,790 --> 00:00:20,800
ataupun hati yang kena kita rawat?

9
00:00:21,007 --> 00:00:22,837
Justeru pada pagi ini,

10
00:00:22,857 --> 00:00:23,987
sebab dia sebut tadi,

11
00:00:24,007 --> 00:00:26,867
kuliah saya, kuliah saya…

12
00:00:27,257 --> 00:00:28,787
Mengingatkan langkah ke masjid,

13
00:00:28,807 --> 00:00:31,317
ubat bagi hati yang malas.

14
00:00:31,507 --> 00:00:33,087
Allah SWT memberikan jawapan

15
00:00:33,107 --> 00:00:34,267
kepada perkara ini.

16
00:00:34,757 --> 00:00:37,487
Dalam surah At-Taubah,

17
00:00:37,507 --> 00:00:39,617
ayat 18.

18
00:00:39,883 --> 00:00:43,083
إِنَّمَا يَعْمُرُ مَسَاجِدَ اللَّهِ

19
00:00:42,533 --> 00:00:45,733
مَنْ آمَنَ بِاللَّهِ وَالْيَوْمِ الْآخِرِ

20
00:00:45,883 --> 00:00:49,083
وَأَقَامَ الصَّلَاةَ وَآتَى الزَّكَاةَ

21
00:00:49,833 --> 00:00:53,033
وَلَمْ يَخْشَ إِلَّا اللَّهَ

22
00:00:52,483 --> 00:00:55,683
فَعَسَىٰ أُولَٰئِكَ أَنْ يَكُونُوا مِنَ الْمُهْتَدِينَ

23
00:00:56,993 --> 00:00:58,333
Itu maksudnya.

24
00:00:59,290 --> 00:01:02,200
Sesungguhnya, orang yang memakmurkan masjid,

25
00:01:02,373 --> 00:01:03,953
orang yang memakmurkan masjid Allah ini

26
00:01:03,973 --> 00:01:06,653
adalah orang yang dalam hatinya

27
00:01:06,673 --> 00:01:08,103
beriman kepada Allah

28
00:01:08,123 --> 00:01:09,933
dan hari akhir.
